; name: Table leg mortises
; group: Rotary axis
; description: A 45 × 45 × 720 mm leg held on the rotary axis (along Y, Z0 on the axis): two apron mortises on adjacent faces, set back from the outside faces: one on top, then a rotate step to 90° for the other. Change the variables for your leg and aprons; round the tenons’ edges to fit the mortises’ r3 corners.
; 
